# DV 1 scheme, tensile correction fully off (TENSILE_CORRECTION 0), conservative GNOG as its replacement (GNOG_PENALTY 2, xi 4 elastic / 0.2 plastic), physical viscosity eta 0.1 on the bodies and the mu = 1 waves
RECON_FACE_DV 1
TENSILE_CORRECTION 0
GNOG_PENALTY 2
MATERIAL_VISCOSITY 1
@mat eta 0.1
@mat eta 0.1 W4p W4s
